  "notes": "Fixes full per-skin persistence on startup. The multi-skin system now blocks startup snapshots while later editor controls are still being created, then reapplies the saved skin state in delayed passes after all controls exist before saving again. Colors, fonts, sizes, toggles, gradients, opacity, panel settings, header settings, tag settings and other controls now persist per skin alongside the already-persistent image assets."
